<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">A Million Types of Kisses (But my Favorites are the ones I Share with You)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;A kiss; an intimate collision of the lips, a sweet greeting on the cheek, or perhaps, an awkward little peck shared with your crush. None of that mattered to Catra, not when she had kissed Adora romantically for the very first time. It wasn't like sparks or any strange description in the books or movies. No. It was like an awakening. Like now, she was complete. She was home with her Adora.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;*All of the types of kisses Catra has had since birth!*&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(Catradora romance one-shot)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Moonii15</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teen And Up Audiences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Lesbian Character</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teen Romance</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teen Crush</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teenagers</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Childhood Friends</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Childhood Memories</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - High School</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Love</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Romance</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Love Confessions</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fluff</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fluffy</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adorable Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Soft Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Latina Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Latin oriented</rdf:li>
